  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8002.19 Responsible managing employee (RME)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8002.19 “Responsible managing employee (RME)” means the designee of the business entity who holds either a current and valid liquefied propane gas service technician license or a natural gas service technician license.\n\nSource. #9542, eff 9-10-09",
